      "S has slightlylowerAbsRel0.0827thanLbest0.0865, but lowerF1about0.636best/0.643final versusparent0.659. Matchedchairoutlinesremainbroadlysimilar, with someextra unmatchedyellowsegments; thinchairlegs remain mostlymissed.",
      "Lfinal improvesitsownAbsRelto0.0696andF1to0.673; JfinalAbsRelimprovesto0.0697whileF1slightlyfalls. The firstjointseed does not show the severe thirdseed collapse documented separately; this fixedfirstseed panel cannot represent all3seeds."
